{"sections":[{"slug":"Young图表","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Young图表"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Young <span lang=\"zh\">图表</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Young 图表"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><strong>Young <span lang=\"zh\">图</span></strong> (Young diagram, Alfred Young) <span lang=\"zh\">是一种方格状图表</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">由若干行列构成</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">每行</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">每列</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的方格数量递减</span>.</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n{ccccc}\r\n\\square &amp; \\square &amp; \\square &amp; \\square &amp; \\square\\\\\r\n\\square &amp; \\square &amp; \\square &amp; \\square &amp; \\\\\r\n\\square &amp; \\square &amp; &amp;&amp;\\\\\r\n\\square &amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<p>Young <span lang=\"zh\">图可用于表现许多对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">如</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">正整数的分拆</span></li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的共轭类</span></li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Schur函子","text":"Schur <span lang=\"zh\">函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>…</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> Young <span lang=\"zh\">图里填一些正整数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">每行递增</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">每列严格递增</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> <strong>Young <span lang=\"zh\">表</span></strong> (tableau).</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n{ccccc}\r\n1 &amp; 2 &amp; 3 &amp; 3 &amp; 4\\\\\r\n2 &amp; 3 &amp; 5 &amp; 5 &amp; \\\\\r\n4 &amp; 5 &amp; &amp;&amp;\\\\\r\n5 &amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}